Added `zizmor <https://docs.zizmor.sh/>`__ security linting of the GitHub Actions workflows, in pre-commit and in a new CI workflow, and fixed its findings: checkouts no longer persist credentials unless they push, workflow permissions are narrowed, untrusted template expansions in ``run:`` steps use environment variables, and reusable workflows use the ``$/`` self-repository syntax (`#54 <https://github.com/sandialabs/PEAT/issues/54>`_).
